EDUCATIONAL-USE NOTICE

This repository contains intentionally vulnerable systems built for security
education. They are meant to be run locally in disposable containers on
hardware you own. Do not deploy them on untrusted networks, and do not use the
techniques demonstrated here against any system you are not explicitly
authorized to test. Unauthorized access to computer systems is illegal.
